        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Socrates</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 470 BCE – 399 BCE</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Born</span><span class="info-stat-val">470 or 469 BCE in the Athenian deme of Alopece, an Athenian citizen; son of Sophroniscus, a stoneworker, and Phaenarete, a midwife</span></div>
