          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Known for</span><span class="info-stat-val">the Socratic method of questioning (elenchus); his claim of ignorance; the search for definitions of the virtues; the view that virtue is knowledge; his trial and death; his influence on <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/plato">Plato</a> and on later schools</span></div>
